    "description": "What really happens when Rupee falls \u2013 and why Sri Lanka is asking the wrong question",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/What-really-happens-when-Rupee-falls-and-why-Sri-Lanka-is-asking-the-wrong-question/4-793331",
