    "description": "Debunking Economic Myths # 1: Central Bank has no role in exchange rate management",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Debunking-Economic-Myths-1-Central-Bank-has-no-role-in-exchange-rate-management/4-793332",
